From 5c9a4abb6ed54d66b29e809e0562829bdb62213d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:59:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Pair charges with the car by the charger's own session data
 (SoC rise, power signature)

ChargerPairing decides from SoC change between charge_start and charge_end and
per-car power/energy limits; ChargerReconciler matches Monta charges to HA
sessions and applies it after every sync and when a session ends. New
'charger' pairingSource ranks below api/manual. Migration 006 casts BLOB
vehicleIds to INTEGER. Ignore *.patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QYwqG6dXAkSHUErVSsbq3F
